The source code in this repository is MIT licensed. The distributed binary (the
.fap.AppImage) links the Slint toolkit through flipctl-app, for which the
GPL-3.0-only option of Slint's tri-license is elected, so the binary as a whole is
GPL-3.0-only, the same arrangement as Flipper's own flipctl apps. The licenses of
every crate linked into the binary are in THIRD-PARTY-LICENSES.md, which ships
inside the bundle.
